{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "granthId": "dasam",
  "ang": 633,
  "lineCount": 48,
  "source": "BaniDB",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0001",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤੀਰਨ ਤੇ ਤਰਵਾਰਨ ਸੇ ਮ੍ਰਿਗ ਬਾਰਨ ਸੇ ਅਵਿਲੋਕਹੁ ਜਾਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "teeran te taravaaran se mirag baaran se avilokahu jaiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਰਾਜੇ ਦੇ ਨੈਣ) ਤੀਰਾ ਵਰਗੇ ਹਨ, ਜਾ ਤਲਵਾਰਾ ਜਿਹੇ ਹਨ, ਜਾ ਹਿਰਨਾ ਦੇ ਬੱਚਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਸਮਾਨ ਹਨ। (ਇਸ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਰ ਦਾ ਨਿਰਨਾ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ) ਜਾ ਕੇ ਵੇਖਣਾ ਚਾਹੀਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तीरन ते तरवारन से मृग बारन से अविलोकहु जाई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101795",
      "sourceShabadId": "9320",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0002",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰੀਝ ਰਹੀ ਰਿਝਵਾਰ ਲਖੇ ਦੁਤਿ ਭਾਖਿ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਨਹੀ ਜਾਤ ਬਤਾਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "reejh rahee rijhavaar lakhe dhut bhaakh prabhaa nahee jaat bataiee ||",
      "translation": "He is impressive like a sword or an arrow his simple beauty like the young one of a deer is worth seeing all are getting pleased on seeing him and his glory is indescribable",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਰਾਜੇ ਦੀ) ਚਮਕ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ (ਸਾਰੀ ਲੁਕਾਈ) ਰੀਝ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਬਾਰੇ ਕਹਿਣਾ ਚਾਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ, ਪਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਕਦੇ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रीझ रही रिझवार लखे दुति भाखि प्रभा नही जात बताई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101796",
      "sourceShabadId": "9320",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੰਗਿ ਚਲੀ ਉਠਿ ਬਾਲ ਬਿਲੋਕਨ ਮੋਰ ਚਕੋਰ ਰਹੇ ਉਰਝਾਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sa(n)g chalee uTh baal bilokan mor chakor rahe urajhaiee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸਤਰੀ (ਰਾਜ ਕੁਮਾਰੀ) ਵੇਖਣ ਲਈ (ਹੋਰਨਾ) ਨਾਲ ਉਠ ਕੇ ਚਲ ਪਈ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੋਰ, ਚਕੋਰ ਵੀ (ਉਸ ਦੇ ਰੂਪ ਦੀ ਸਥਿਤੀ ਬਾਰੇ) ਉਲਝੇ ਹੋਏ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "संगि चली उठि बाल बिलोकन मोर चकोर रहे उरझाई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101797",
      "sourceShabadId": "9320",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0004",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "gurmukhi": "ਡੀਠਿ ਪਰੈ ਅਜਿ ਰਾਜ ਜਬੈ ਚਿਤ ਦੇਖਤ ਹੀ ਤ੍ਰੀਅ ਲੀਨ ਚੁਰਾਈ ॥੮੫॥",
      "transliteration": "ddeeTh parai aj raaj jabai chit dhekhat hee treea leen churaiee ||85||",
      "translation": "The princess is moving forward to see him and seeing him, the peacocks and partridges have fallen in confusion the heart of that princess was fascinated, the moment she saw the king Aj.85.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਸ ਵੇਲੇ ਅਜ ਰਾਜਾ ਦਿਖ ਗਿਆ, ਵੇਖਦਿਆਂ ਹੀ ਰਾਜ ਕੁਮਾਰੀ ਦੇ ਚਿਤ ਨੂੰ ਚੁਰਾ ਲਿਆ ॥੮੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "डीठि परै अजि राज जबै चित देखत ही त्रीअ लीन चुराई ॥८५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101798",
      "sourceShabadId": "9320",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0005",
      "lineIndex": 5,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤੋਮਰ ਛੰਦ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tomar chha(n)dh ||",
      "translation": "TOMAR STANZA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੋਮਰ ਛੰਦ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तोमर छंद ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101799",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0006",
      "lineIndex": 6,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਵਿਲੋਕੀਆ ਅਜਿ ਰਾਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "avilokeeaa aj raaj ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਰਾਜ ਕੁਮਾਰੀ ਨੇ) ਅਜ ਰਾਜੇ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਲਿਆ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अविलोकीआ अजि राज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101800",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0007",
      "lineIndex": 7,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਤਿ ਰੂਪ ਸਰਬ ਸਮਾਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "at roop sarab samaaj ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਹ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲਾ ਅਤੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਸਮਾਜ ਸਹਿਤ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अति रूप सरब समाज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101801",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0008",
      "lineIndex": 8,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਤਿ ਰੀਝ ਕੈ ਹਸ ਬਾਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "at reejh kai has baal ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਹੁਤ ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਅਤੇ ਹਸ ਕੇ (ਰਾਜ ਕੁਮਾਰੀ ਨੇ)",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अति रीझ कै हस बाल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101802",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0009",
      "lineIndex": 9,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗੁਹਿ ਫੂਲ ਮਾਲ ਉਤਾਲ ॥੮੬॥",
      "transliteration": "guh fool maal utaal ||86||",
      "translation": "When the princess saw the king, the treasure of beauty, she held her wreath of flowers with smile.86.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਛੇਤੀ ਹੀ ਫੁਲਾ ਦੀ ਮਾਲਾ ਗੁੰਦ ਲਈ ॥੮੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गुहि फूल माल उताल ॥८६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101803",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0010",
      "lineIndex": 10,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗਹਿ ਫੂਲ ਕੀ ਕਰਿ ਮਾਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "geh fool kee kar maal ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) ਫੁਲਾ ਦੀ ਮਾਲਾ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ ਫੜ ਲਈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गहि फूल की करि माल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101804",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0011",
      "lineIndex": 11,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਤਿ ਰੂਪਵੰਤ ਸੁ ਬਾਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "at roopava(n)t su baal ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਹ ਰਾਜ ਕੁਮਾਰੀ ਬਹੁਤ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੀ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अति रूपवंत सु बाल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101805",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0012",
      "lineIndex": 12,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਸੁ ਡਾਰੀਆ ਉਰਿ ਆਨਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tis ddaareeaa ur aan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਨੇ ਆ ਕੇ (ਅਜ ਰਾਜਾ) ਦੇ ਗਲੇ ਵਿਚ ਮਾਲਾ ਪਾ ਦਿੱਤੀ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिसु डारीआ उरि आनि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101806",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0013",
      "lineIndex": 13,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਸ ਚਾਰਿ ਚਾਰਿ ਨਿਧਾਨਿ ॥੮੭॥",
      "transliteration": "dhas chaar chaar nidhaan ||87||",
      "translation": "The charming damsel caught the garland in her hand and put it around the neck of the king, expert in eighteen sciences.87.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੋ ਅਠਾਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਿਧੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਸੁਆਮੀ ਸੀ ॥੮੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दस चारि चारि निधानि ॥८७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101807",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਹ ਦੇਬਿ ਆਗਿਆ ਕੀਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "teh dheb aagiaa keen ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਦੇਵੀ (ਸਰਸਵਤੀ) ਨੇ ਆਗਿਆ ਕੀਤੀ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिह देबि आगिआ कीन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101808",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਸ ਚਾਰਿ ਚਾਰਿ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhas chaar chaar prabeen ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੋ ਅਠਾਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਕਲਾਵਾ ਵਿਚ ਨਿਪੁਣ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दस चारि चारि प्रबीन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101809",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁਨਿ ਸੁੰਦਰੀ ਇਮ ਬੈਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sun su(n)dharee im bain ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸੁੰਦਰੀ! ਇਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਬਚਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਣੋ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुनि सुँदरी इम बैन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101810",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਸਿ ਕ੍ਰਾਤ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਨੈਨ ॥੮੮॥",
      "transliteration": "sas kraat su(n)dhar nain ||88||",
      "translation": "The goddess said to that princess, who was expert in all sciences, “O beautiful maiden like moonlight having charming eyes! listen to what I say.88.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਨੈਣ ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ ਵਾਗ ਜੋਤਿਮਈ ਹਨ ॥੮੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ससि क्रात सुँदर नैन ॥८८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101811",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਵ ਜੋਗ ਹੈ ਅਜਿ ਰਾਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tav jog hai aj raaj ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਜ ਰਾਜਾ ਤੇਰਾ (ਪਤੀ ਹੋਣ) ਯੋਗ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तव जोग है अजि राज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101812",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁਨ ਰੂਪਵੰਤ ਸਲਾਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sun roopava(n)t salaaj ||",
      "translation": "“O princess full of charm and shyness! the king Aj is worthy match for you",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸੁਣ, ਉਹ ਰੂਪਵਾਨ ਅਤੇ ਲਾਜ ਸਹਿਤ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुन रूपवंत सलाज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101813",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0020",
      "lineIndex": 20,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਰੁ ਆਜੁ ਤਾ ਕਹ ਜਾਇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bar aaj taa keh jai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੁਣੇ ਜਾ ਕੇ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਵਰ ਲੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बरु आजु ता कह जाइ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101814",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0021",
      "lineIndex": 21,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁਨਿ ਬੈਨਿ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਕਾਇ ॥੮੯॥",
      "transliteration": "sun bain su(n)dhar kai ||89||",
      "translation": "You see him and listen to my speech”89.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸ਼ਰੀਰ ਵਾਲੀਏ! (ਮੇਰੇ) ਬਚਨ ਸੁਣ ਲੈ ॥੮੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुनि बैनि सुँदर काइ ॥८९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101815",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0022",
      "lineIndex": 22,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗਹਿ ਫੂਲ ਮਾਲ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "geh fool maal prabeen ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ (ਰਾਜ ਕੁਮਾਰੀ) ਨੇ ਫੁਲਾ ਦੀ ਮਾਲਾ ਪਕੜ ਕੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गहि फूल माल प्रबीन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101816",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0023",
      "lineIndex": 23,
      "gurmukhi": "ਉਰਿ ਡਾਰ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਦੀਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aur ddaar taa ke dheen ||",
      "translation": "The princess caught the wreath of flowers and put it around the neck of the king and",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਗਲ ਵਿਚ ਪਾ ਦਿੱਤੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "उरि डार ता के दीन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101817",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0024",
      "lineIndex": 24,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਬ ਬਾਜ ਤੂਰ ਅਨੇਕ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tab baaj toor anek ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਵੇਲੇ ਖ਼ਾਸ ਕਰ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तब बाज तूर अनेक ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101818",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0025",
      "lineIndex": 25,
      "gurmukhi": "ਡਫ ਬੀਣ ਬੇਣ ਬਸੇਖ ॥੯੦॥",
      "transliteration": "ddaf been ben basekh ||90||",
      "translation": "At that time many musical instruments including the lyre were played.90.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਡਫ਼, ਬੀਨ, ਬੇਣ ਅਤੇ ਤੂਰ ਆਦਿ ਵਜੇ ਵਜਣ ਲਗੇ ॥੯੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "डफ बीण बेण बसेख ॥९०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101819",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਡਫ ਬਾਜ ਢੋਲ ਮ੍ਰਿਦੰਗ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ddaf baaj ddol miradha(n)g ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਡਫ, ਢੋਲ, ਮ੍ਰਿਦੰਗ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "डफ बाज ढोल मृदंग ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101820",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਤਿ ਤੂਰ ਤਾਨ ਤਰੰਗ ॥",
      "transliteration": "at toor taan tara(n)g ||",
      "translation": "The tabor, drum, kettledrum and many other musical instruments of various tunes and tones were played",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂਰ, ਤਾਨ, ਤਰੰਗ, ਨਵੀਂ ਬੰਸੁਰੀ ਆਦਿ ਵਾਜੇ ਵਜਦੇ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अति तूर तान तरंग ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101821",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਯ ਬਾਸੁਰੀ ਅਰੁ ਬੈਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nay baasuree ar bain ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੀ ਤਾਨ ਨਾਲ ਬੋਲ ਮਿਲਾ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नय बासुरी अरु बैन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101822",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁ ਸੁੰਦਰੀ ਸੁਭ ਨੈਨ ॥੯੧॥",
      "transliteration": "bahu su(n)dharee subh nain ||91||",
      "translation": "The flutes were played and there were many beautiful ladies of charming eyes seated there.91.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਹੁਤ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੁਭ ਨੈਣਾ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ (ਇਸਤਰੀਆਂ ਗਾਉਾਂਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ) ॥੯੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहु सुँदरी सुभ नैन ॥९१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101823",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਹ ਬਿਆਹਿ ਕੈ ਅਜਿ ਰਾਜਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "teh biaaeh kai aj raaj ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਅਜ ਰਾਜਾ ਵਿਆਹ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिह बिआहि कै अजि राजि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101824",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁ ਭਾਤਿ ਲੈ ਕਰ ਦਾਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bahu bhaat lai kar dhaaj ||",
      "translation": "The king Aj wedded that damsel and taking various types of dowry and",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਬਹੁਤ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ ਦਾਜ ਲੈ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहु भाति लै कर दाज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101825",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗ੍ਰਿਹ ਆਈਆ ਸੁਖ ਪਾਇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "gireh aaieeaa sukh pai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਸੁਖ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਕਰ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गृह आईआ सुख पाइ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101826",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਡਫ ਬੇਣ ਬੀਣ ਬਜਾਇ ॥੯੨॥",
      "transliteration": "ddaf ben been bajai ||92||",
      "translation": "Causing the tabor and lyre to be played, he retuned home with great happiness.92.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਡਫ, ਬੇਣ ਅਤੇ ਬੀਨ ਵਜਾਉਾਂਦਾ ਘਰ ਆ ਗਿਆ ॥੯੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "डफ बेण बीण बजाइ ॥९२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101827",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਜਿ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜ ਮਹਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aj raaj raaj mahaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਜ ਰਾਜ ਬਹੁਤ ਮਹਾਨ ਰਾਜਾ ਹੈ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अजि राज राज महान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101828",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਸ ਚਾਰਿ ਚਾਰਿ ਨਿਧਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhas chaar chaar nidhaan ||",
      "translation": "The king expert in eighteen sciences, was the ocean of pleasure and store of gentleness",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਅਠਾਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਿਧੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਸੁਆਮੀ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दस चारि चारि निधान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101829",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁਖ ਸਿੰਧੁ ਸੀਲ ਸਮੁੰਦ੍ਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sukh si(n)dh seel samu(n)dhr ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਹ ਸੁਖ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੀਲ ਦਾ ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਹੈ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुख सिंधु सील समुँद्र ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101830",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਿਨਿ ਜੀਤਿਆ ਰਣ ਰੁਦ੍ਰ ॥੯੩॥",
      "transliteration": "jin jeetiaa ran rudhr ||93||",
      "translation": "He had conquered even Shiva in the war.93.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਸ ਨੇ ਯੁੱਧ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ ਰੁਦ੍ਰ ਨੂੰ ਜਿਤ ਲਿਆ ਸੀ ॥੯੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जिनि जीतिआ रण रुद्र ॥९३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101831",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਹ ਭਾਤਿ ਰਾਜ ਕਮਾਇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eeh bhaat raaj kamai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ (ਉਸ ਨੇ) ਰਾਜ ਕਮਾਇਆ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इह भाति राज कमाइ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101832",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਿਰਿ ਅਤ੍ਰ ਪਤ੍ਰ ਫਿਰਾਇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sir atr patr firai ||",
      "translation": "In this waay, he ruled and caused the canopy to be swung over his head and in the whole world,",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਸਿਰ ਉਤੇ ਛਤ੍ਰ ਝੁਲਵਾਇਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सिरि अत्र पत्र फिराइ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101833",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਣ ਧੀਰ ਰਾਜ ਬਿਸੇਖ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ran dheer raaj bisekh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਹ ਵਿਸ਼ੇਸ਼ ਰੂਪ ਵਿਚ ਰਣਧੀਰ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रण धीर राज बिसेख ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101834",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਗ ਕੀਨ ਜਾਸੁ ਭਿਖੇਖ ॥੯੪॥",
      "transliteration": "jag keen jaas bhikhekh ||94||",
      "translation": "The ceremonies regarding he divine kingship of that victorious king were performed.94.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਨੇ ਰਾਜ ਤਿਲਕ ਵੇਲੇ ਯੱਗ ਕੀਤਾ ਹੈ ॥੯੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जग कीन जासु भिखेख ॥९४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101835",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਗਜੀਤ ਚਾਰਿ ਦਿਸਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jagajeet chaar dhisaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਨੇ) ਜਗਤ ਦੀਆਂ ਚੌਹਾ ਦਿਸ਼ਾਵਾ ਨੂੰ ਜਿਤ ਲਿਆ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जगजीत चारि दिसान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101836",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਜਿ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜ ਮਹਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aj raaj raaj mahaan ||",
      "translation": "The king Aj, after conquering all the four directions, gave charities of materials as a generous king",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਜ ਰਾਜਾ ਬਹੁਤ ਮਹਾਨ ਰਾਜਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अजि राज राज महान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101837",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਪ ਦਾਨ ਸੀਲ ਪਹਾਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirap dhaan seel pahaar ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਹ) ਰਾਜਾ ਦਾਨ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੀਲ ਦਾ ਪਹਾੜ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृप दान सील पहार ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101838",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਸ ਚਾਰਿ ਚਾਰਿ ਉਦਾਰ ॥੯੫॥",
      "transliteration": "dhas chaar chaar udhaar ||95||",
      "translation": "Being expert in all sciences, that king was extremely benevolent.95.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਹ ਅਠਾਰ੍ਰਹਾ (ਵਿਦਿਆਵਾ) ਵਿਚ ਬਹੁਤ ਉਦਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੯੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दस चारि चारि उदार ॥९५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101839",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੁਤਿਵੰਤਿ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਨੈਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhutiva(n)t su(n)dhar nain ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸੁੰਦਰ ਚਮਕ ਦਮਕ ਵਾਲਾ ਅਤੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਨੈਣਾ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दुतिवंति सुँदर नैन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101840",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਿਹ ਪੇਖਿ ਖਿਝਤ ਮੈਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jeh pekh khijhat main ||",
      "translation": "His eyes and body were so charming, hat even the god of love felt jealous",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਸ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਕਾਮਦੇਵ ਵੀ ਖਿਝਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जिह पेखि खिझत मैन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101841",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0633_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੁਖ ਦੇਖਿ ਚੰਦ੍ਰ ਸਰੂਪ ॥",
      "transliteration": "mukh dhekh cha(n)dhr saroop ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦਾ) ਮੁਖ ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ ਵਰਗਾ ਦਿਖਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 633,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मुख देखि चंद्र सरूप ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101842",
      "sourceShabadId": "9321",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    }
  ]
}
